<title>JAPAN: NEC - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>NEC - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.82 trln	 vs	    1.52 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   34.06		vs	   30.80</p>
<p> Current	     40.16		vs	   30.51</p>
<p> Net		   30.99		vs	   15.51</p>
<p> EPS		   20.04 yen	  vs	   10.06 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   1.55 billion	  vs	1.54 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.50 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - NEC Corp specialises in computers and communications equipment.</p>
